.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt EXIT 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm exit
.Nd terminate the calling process
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft void
.Fn exit "int code"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The .Nm system call terminates the calling process and all of its threads.
.Pp
This page documents the native RavenBSD ABI; see the
.Pa raven-abi
crate for the exact numeric value and types.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn exit
 does not return.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
